	(text "Rows: a 47k load each to GND (BED_5, \"fsr_load\": 47000); the board's series resistor on\nthree of the rows (not row 3, act-6). Columns: FSR_X = [10, 9, 12, 11, 8, 13, 14, 15].\nBED_3 (fsr_bed3.json) swaps rows 2 and 3: GP26 / GP27."
